{
  "name": "S1",
  "about": "Plan C 3.8 script S1 (C4). Compare mode, pose rts80 (and oblique). before + before_aa 1 s apart (A/A floor), bg (terrain hidden); five sculpt modes then two paint strokes; pre_last2; the last two strokes (raise across the chunk corner at (32,32), paint snow) with their footprints (set last2; every stroke also joins set all, projected as rts80/all_after for S1L's footprint mask); after (depthchecks at after and undo add 2,000 draws from the last2 footprint); undo 2 (hash must equal pre_last2); redo 2 (hash must equal after); look full shots closeup + oblique; save (terrain.json: sim_grid_fnv + 16 probes, height.r32, splat.rgba8). Map-metre coordinates: X east, Y = Unreal +Y; the rts80 camera looks along +Y from y=-51 m. Probe points (TerrainSimExport::GetProbePoints) sit in: the valley (0,0),(-0.5,0.5),(1,-1),(-1,-1),(-1-eps,-1-eps),(10.5,-3.25) = negative non-exact heights; the west hill (-77.75,42.125); the corner raise (31.99998,31.99998),(32,32); the far valley (-100.5,-100.5); the far hill (100.5,100.5); flat: the map corners and (64,-64). wait_collision / verify_collision (C5) run at the four P5 checkpoints pre_last2, after, undo and redo. A stroke with hitch=true takes the -ChimeraTerrainHitchMs hitch (P8).",
  "ops": [
    {"op": "look", "mode": "compare"},
    {"op": "camera", "pose": "rts80"},
    {"op": "settle", "frames": 30},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "before"},
    {"op": "idle", "seconds": 1},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "before_aa"},
    {"op": "visible", "value": 0},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "bg"},
    {"op": "visible", "value": 1},

    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "raise", "d": 40, "s": 60, "path": [[-62, 38]], "ticks": 40, "fp": "all", "phase": "sculpt", "hitch": true},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "raise", "d": 16, "s": 40, "path": [[15, 5], [15, 70]], "ticks": 60, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "lower", "d": 36, "s": 25, "path": [[-15, -5], [15, -5]], "ticks": 40, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "raise", "d": 30, "s": 40, "path": [[100, 100]], "ticks": 20, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "lower", "d": 20, "s": 30, "path": [[-100, -100]], "ticks": 15, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "smooth", "d": 40, "s": 50, "path": [[-62, 38], [-30, 38]], "ticks": 30, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "raise", "d": 30, "s": 60, "path": [[55, 60]], "ticks": 20, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "flatten", "d": 30, "s": 100, "path": [[55, 60]], "ticks": 30, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "sculpt"},

    {"op": "paint", "layer": 1, "d": 6, "s": 100, "path": [[-60, -20], [-20, 10], [20, 40], [60, 70]], "ticks": 60, "fp": "all", "phase": "paint"},
    {"op": "paint", "layer": 2, "d": 14, "s": 100, "path": [[-70, 34], [-52, 42]], "ticks": 40, "fp": "all"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "paint"},

    {"op": "wait_collision", "name": "pre_last2"},
    {"op": "verify_collision", "name": "pre_last2"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "rts80", "name": "pre_last2_rts80"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "oblique", "name": "pre_last2_oblique"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "pre_last2"},
    {"op": "hash", "name": "pre_last2"},

    {"op": "stroke", "mode": "raise", "d": 30, "s": 60, "path": [[24, 24], [40, 40]], "ticks": 30, "fp": ["last2", "all"], "phase": "last2"},
    {"op": "paint", "layer": 3, "d": 24, "s": 100, "path": [[26, 30], [38, 34]], "ticks": 30, "fp": ["last2", "all"]},
    {"op": "hash", "name": "after"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "after"},
    {"op": "project_footprint", "pose": "rts80", "name": "last2", "as": "last2_after"},
    {"op": "project_footprint", "pose": "rts80", "name": "all", "as": "all_after"},
    {"op": "wait_collision", "name": "after"},
    {"op": "verify_collision", "name": "after"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "rts80", "name": "after_rts80", "fp": "last2"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "oblique", "name": "after_oblique", "fp": "last2"},

    {"op": "undo", "n": 2},
    {"op": "hash", "name": "undo"},
    {"op": "wait_collision", "name": "undo"},
    {"op": "verify_collision", "name": "undo"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "rts80", "name": "undo_rts80", "fp": "last2"},
    {"op": "depthcheck", "pose": "oblique", "name": "undo_oblique", "fp": "last2"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "undo"},
    {"op": "project_footprint", "pose": "rts80", "name": "last2", "as": "last2_flat"},

    {"op": "redo", "n": 2},
    {"op": "hash", "name": "redo"},
    {"op": "wait_collision", "name": "redo"},
    {"op": "verify_collision", "name": "redo"},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "redo"},

    {"op": "look", "mode": "full"},
    {"op": "settle", "frames": 120},
    {"op": "camera", "pose": "closeup"},
    {"op": "settle", "frames": 10},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "closeup"},
    {"op": "camera", "pose": "oblique"},
    {"op": "settle", "frames": 10},
    {"op": "shot", "name": "oblique"},
    {"op": "save"}
  ]
}
